      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "You know your teen best. Look for changes that seem out of character or don't have another clear explanation: * New or unfamiliar Snapchat contacts, especially ones using lots of slang, emojis, or vague usernames. * Quickly closing or deleting Snapchat conversations when you walk by. * Unexplained packages arriving—or sudden trips out to \"grab something\" without a clear reason. * Mood swings, sleep issues, changes in appetite, or shifts in appearance. * Missing money, new cash requests, or unusual gift card purchases."
